{"id":"d6dc2d5ad806772c0fc94c26faadf3eb7a6b5306","axis":"silent","repo":"codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4","sha":"d6dc2d5ad806772c0fc94c26faadf3eb7a6b5306","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"docs/changelogs/v4.7.7.md","lines":["@@ -15,5 +15,6 @@ Release Date: Unreleased"," ## Bugs Fixed"," "," - **Security:** Fixed a bug where `Security::__construct()` threw a `TypeError` when the CSRF cookie was an array, causing an HTTP 500 response for affected requests.","+- **Worker Mode:** Fixed a bug where every request that ended with an uncaught exception, including a `404 Page Not Found` without a 404 override, called `exit()` in the exception handler. This ended the worker script, so FrankenPHP booted a new one, and the worker loop skipped its cleanup after the request. The exception handler now returns to the worker loop."," "," See the repo's [CHANGELOG.md](https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/CHANGELOG.md) for a complete list of bugs fixed."],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/installation/worker_mode.md","lines":["@@ -148,7 +148,7 @@ The `$persistentServices` array controls which services survive between requests"," |----|----|"," | `autoloader` | PSR-4 autoloading configuration. Safe to persist as class maps don't change. |"," | `locator` | File locator for finding framework files. Caches file paths for performance. |","-| `exceptions` | Exception handler. Stateless, safe to reuse. |","+| `exceptions` | Exception handler. Its request state is cleared before each request. |"," | `commands` | CLI commands registry. Only used during worker startup. |"," | `codeigniter` | Main application instance. Orchestrates the request/response cycle. |"," | `superglobals` | Superglobals wrapper. Properly isolated per request internally. |","@@ -249,6 +249,12 @@ Worker Mode can make debugging more challenging since the process persists acros"," - **Check logs** in **writable/logs/** for connection and state-related issues"," - **Use logging liberally** to trace request flow across the persistent process"," ","+### Error Handling","+","+When a request ends with an uncaught exception, such as a `PageNotFoundException`, the exception handler displays the error and returns to the worker loop, which cleans up after the request as usual. The worker does not restart.","+","+If you use a custom exception handler (see [Custom Exception Handlers](../general/errors.md#custom-exception-handlers)), do not call `exit()` in it. In Worker Mode, `exit()` ends the worker script, and FrankenPHP has to boot a new one.","+"," ### Session and Cache Handlers"," "," **File-based handlers** may experience file locking contention between workers. For production environments, consider using:"],"additions":7,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"system/Boot.php","lines":["@@ -30,6 +30,11 @@","  */"," class Boot"," {","+    /**","+     * Whether the application was booted by `bootWorker()`.","+     */","+    private static bool $workerMode = false;","+","     /**","      * Used by `public/index.php`","      *","@@ -87,6 +92,8 @@ public static function bootWeb(Paths $paths): int","      */","     public static function bootWorker(Paths $paths): CodeIgniter","     {","+        self::$workerMode = true;","+","         static::definePathConstants($paths);","         if (! defined('APP_NAMESPACE')) {","             static::loadConstants();","@@ -109,6 +116,16 @@ public static function bootWorker(Paths $paths): CodeIgniter","         return Boot::initializeCodeIgniter();","     }"," ","+    /**","+     * Whether the application runs in FrankenPHP worker mode.","+     *","+     * @internal","+     */","+    public static function isWorkerMode(): bool","+    {","+        return self::$workerMode;","+    }","+","     /**","      * Used by command line scripts other than","      * * `spark`"],"additions":17,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"system/CodeIgniter.php","lines":["@@ -208,6 +208,10 @@ public function resetForWorkerMode(): void","         $this->totalTime = 0;"," ","         $this->resetKintForWorkerMode();","+","+        if (Services::has('exceptions')) {","+            Services::exceptions()->resetForWorkerMode();","+        }","     }"," ","     /**"],"additions":4,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"system/Debug/ExceptionHandler.php","lines":["@@ -15,6 +15,7 @@"," "," use Closure;"," use CodeIgniter\\API\\ResponseTrait;","+use CodeIgniter\\Boot;"," use CodeIgniter\\Exceptions\\PageNotFoundException;"," use CodeIgniter\\HTTP\\CLIRequest;"," use CodeIgniter\\HTTP\\Exceptions\\HTTPException;","@@ -91,7 +92,7 @@ public function handle("," ","                 $this->respond($data, $statusCode)->send();"," ","-                if (ENVIRONMENT !== 'testing') {","+                if ($this->shouldExit()) {","                     // @codeCoverageIgnoreStart","                     exit($exitCode);","                     // @codeCoverageIgnoreEnd","@@ -122,13 +123,24 @@ public function handle(","         // Displays the HTML or CLI error code.","         $this->render($exception, $statusCode, $viewFile);"," ","-        if (ENVIRONMENT !== 'testing') {","+        if ($this->shouldExit()) {","             // @codeCoverageIgnoreStart","             exit($exitCode);","             // @codeCoverageIgnoreEnd","         }","     }"," ","+    /**","+     * Whether to end the script after the error is displayed.","+     *","+     * In worker mode, the worker loop must keep running, so the","+     * handler returns and the worker cleans up after the request.","+     */","+    private function shouldExit(): bool","+    {","+        return ENVIRONMENT !== 'testing' && ! Boot::isWorkerMode();","+    }","+","     /**","      * Determines the view to display based on the exception thrown, HTTP status","      * code, whether an HTTP or CLI request, etc."],"additions":14,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"system/Debug/Exceptions.php","lines":["@@ -14,6 +14,7 @@"," namespace CodeIgniter\\Debug;"," "," use CodeIgniter\\API\\ResponseTrait;","+use CodeIgniter\\Boot;"," use CodeIgniter\\Exceptions\\HasExitCodeInterface;"," use CodeIgniter\\Exceptions\\HTTPExceptionInterface;"," use CodeIgniter\\Exceptions\\PageNotFoundException;","@@ -69,7 +70,7 @@ class Exceptions","     /**","      * The outgoing response.","      *","-     * @var ResponseInterface","+     * @var ResponseInterface|null","      */","     protected $response;"," ","@@ -174,13 +175,31 @@ public function exceptionHandler(Throwable $exception)","             if (! str_contains($this->request->getHeaderLine('accept'), 'text/html')) {","                 $this->respond(ENVIRONMENT === 'development' ? $this->collectVars($exception, $statusCode) : '', $statusCode)->send();"," ","-                exit($exitCode);","+                if (! Boot::isWorkerMode()) {","+                    exit($exitCode);","+                }","+","+                return;","             }","         }"," ","         $this->render($exception, $statusCode);"," ","-        exit($exitCode);","+        if (! Boot::isWorkerMode()) {","+            exit($exitCode);","+        }","+    }","+","+    /**","+     * Clears the state of the previous request in worker mode.","+     *","+     * @internal","+     */","+    public function resetForWorkerMode(): void","+    {","+        $this->exceptionCaughtByExceptionHandler = null;","+        $this->request                           = null;","+        $this->response                          = null;","     }"," ","     /**"],"additions":22,"deletions":3,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/system/CodeIgniterTest.php","lines":["@@ -18,6 +18,7 @@"," use CodeIgniter\\Config\\Services;"," use CodeIgniter\\Debug\\Timer;"," use CodeIgniter\\Exceptions\\PageNotFoundException;","+use CodeIgniter\\Exceptions\\RuntimeException;"," use CodeIgniter\\HTTP\\Method;"," use CodeIgniter\\HTTP\\Response;"," use CodeIgniter\\HTTP\\ResponseInterface;","@@ -1309,6 +1310,23 @@ public function testResetForWorkerMode(): void","         $this->assertTrue(RichRenderer::$needs_pre_render);","     }"," ","+    public function testResetForWorkerModeClearsExceptionsState(): void","+    {","+        $this->resetServices();","+","+        $exceptions = Services::exceptions();","+        $this->setPrivateProperty($exceptions, 'exceptionCaughtByExceptionHandler', new RuntimeException('Previous request'));","+        $this->setPrivateProperty($exceptions, 'request', service('request'));","+        $this->setPrivateProperty($exceptions, 'response', service('response'));","+","+        $codeigniter = new MockCodeIgniter(new App());","+        $codeigniter->resetForWorkerMode();","+","+        $this->assertNull($this->getPrivateProperty($exceptions, 'exceptionCaughtByExceptionHandler'));","+        $this->assertNull($this->getPrivateProperty($exceptions, 'request'));","+        $this->assertNull($this->getPrivateProperty($exceptions, 'response'));","+    }","+","     public function testGatherOutputCalledOnceWhenControllerReturnsResponse(): void","     {","         $this->resetServices();"],"additions":18,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/system/Debug/ExceptionHandlerTest.php","lines":["@@ -22,6 +22,7 @@"," use CodeIgniter\\Test\\StreamFilterTrait;"," use Config\\Exceptions as ExceptionsConfig;"," use Config\\Services;","+use PHPUnit\\Framework\\Attributes\\DataProvider;"," use PHPUnit\\Framework\\Attributes\\Group;"," use stdClass;"," ","@@ -168,6 +169,76 @@ public function testHandleCLIPageNotFoundException(): void","         $this->resetStreamFilterBuffer();","     }"," ","+    /**","+     * The handler can only exit outside the testing environment, so it","+     * runs in a separate process with the production environment.","+     */","+    #[DataProvider('provideHandleWebExceptionExitBehavior')]","+    public function testHandleWebExceptionExitBehavior(","+        string $accept,","+        bool $workerMode,","+        string $expectedOutput,","+        int $expectedStatus,","+    ): void {","+        $escapedHomePath  = var_export(HOMEPATH, true);","+        $escapedBootstrap = var_export(SYSTEMPATH . 'util_bootstrap.php', true);","+        $escapedAccept    = var_export($accept, true);","+        $escapedWorker    = var_export($workerMode, true);","+","+        $code = <<<PHP","+            chdir({$escapedHomePath});","+            define('ENVIRONMENT', 'production');","+            require {$escapedBootstrap};","+","+            use CodeIgniter\\\\Boot;","+            use CodeIgniter\\\\Debug\\\\ExceptionHandler;","+            use CodeIgniter\\\\Exceptions\\\\PageNotFoundException;","+            use Config\\\\Exceptions as ExceptionsConfig;","+","+            (new \\\\ReflectionProperty(Boot::class, 'workerMode'))->setValue(null, {$escapedWorker});","+","+            \\$request = service('incomingrequest', null, false);","+            \\$request->setHeader('accept', {$escapedAccept});","+","+            (new ExceptionHandler(new ExceptionsConfig()))->handle(","+                PageNotFoundException::forPageNotFound(),","+                \\$request,","+                service('response'),","+                404,","+                EXIT_UNKNOWN_FILE,","+            );","+","+            echo 'HANDLER RETURNED';","+            PHP;","+","+        $cmd = sprintf('%s -r %s 2>&1', escapeshellarg(PHP_BINARY), escapeshellarg($code));","+        exec($cmd, $output, $status);","+        $output = implode(PHP_EOL, $output);","+","+        $this->assertSame($expectedStatus, $status, $output);","+        $this->assertStringContainsString($expectedOutput, $output);","+","+        if ($workerMode) {","+            $this->assertStringEndsWith('HANDLER RETURNED', $output);","+        } else {","+            $this->assertStringNotContainsString('HANDLER RETURNED', $output);","+        }","+    }","+","+    /**","+     * @return iterable<string, array{string, bool, string, int}>","+     */","+    public static function provideHandleWebExceptionExitBehavior(): iterable","+    {","+        yield 'non-HTML, worker mode' => ['application/json', true, '\"\"', 0];","+","+        yield 'non-HTML, traditional' => ['application/json', false, '\"\"', EXIT_UNKNOWN_FILE];","+","+        yield 'HTML, worker mode' => ['text/html', true, '<title>404 - Page Not Found</title>', 0];","+","+        yield 'HTML, traditional' => ['text/html', false, '<title>404 - Page Not Found</title>', EXIT_UNKNOWN_FILE];","+    }","+","     public function testMaskSensitiveData(): void","     {","         $maskSensitiveData = self::getPrivateMethodInvoker($this->handler, 'maskSensitiveData');"],"additions":71,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/system/Debug/ExceptionsTest.php","lines":["@@ -205,4 +205,17 @@ public function testMaskSensitiveDataTraceDataKey(): void"," ","         $this->assertSame('/var/www/CodeIgniter4/app/Controllers/Home.php', $newTrace[0]['file']);","     }","+","+    public function testResetForWorkerModeClearsPreviousRequestState(): void","+    {","+        $this->setPrivateProperty($this->exception, 'exceptionCaughtByExceptionHandler', new RuntimeException('Previous request'));","+        $this->setPrivateProperty($this->exception, 'request', service('request'));","+        $this->setPrivateProperty($this->exception, 'response', service('response'));","+","+        $this->exception->resetForWorkerMode();","+","+        $this->assertNull($this->getPrivateProperty($this->exception, 'exceptionCaughtByExceptionHandler'));","+        $this->assertNull($this->getPrivateProperty($this->exception, 'request'));","+        $this->assertNull($this->getPrivateProperty($this->exception, 'response'));","+    }"," }",""],"additions":13,"deletions":0,"truncated":false}],"additions":167,"deletions":6,"truncated":false,"file_count":9},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-11-05T16:29:16.719159+00:00"}